1b:T66c0,<p>The <code>transport</code> option lets you replace the default <code>fetch</code> implementation with a custom function. This is useful for HTTP/2, request mocking, logging proxies, or any custom network adapter.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Swap out the entire HTTP layer without changing application code.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="basic-usage">Basic Usage</h2>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre style="background-color:#22272e;color:#adbac7" tabindex="0" data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed"><code data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed" style="display: grid;"><span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">import</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> { createClient, </span><span style="color:#F47067">type</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> SolvixTransport } </span><span style="color:#F47067">from</span><span style="color:#96D0FF"> "@adityadev13/solvix"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">;</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> loggingTransport</span><span style="color:#F47067">:</span><span style="color:#F69D50"> SolvixTransport</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#F47067"> async</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (</span><span style="color:#F69D50">url</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#F69D50">init</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">) </span><span style="color:#F47067">=></span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  console.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">log</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">`→ ${</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">init</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">.</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">method</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">} ${</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">url</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">}`</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> start</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> Date.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">now</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">();</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> response</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#F47067"> await</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> fetch</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(url, init);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  console.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">log</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">`← ${</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">response</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">.</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">status</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">} (${</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">Date</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">now</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">() </span><span style="color:#F47067">-</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> start</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">}ms)`</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  return</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> response;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">};</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> client</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> createClient</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">({</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  baseURL: </span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"https://api.example.com"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">,</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  transport: loggingTransport,</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">});</span></span></code></pre></figure>
<h2 id="type-signature">Type Signature</h2>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre style="background-color:#22272e;color:#adbac7" tabindex="0" data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed"><code data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed" style="display: grid;"><span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">type</span><span style="color:#F69D50"> SolvixTransport</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F69D50">  url</span><span style="color:#F47067">:</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> string</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">,</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F69D50">  init</span><span style="color:#F47067">:</span><span style="color:#F69D50"> RequestInit</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">) </span><span style="color:#F47067">=></span><span style="color:#F69D50"> Promise</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">&#x3C;</span><span style="color:#F69D50">Response</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">>;</span></span></code></pre></figure>
<p>The transport receives the <strong>resolved URL</strong> (with baseURL and params applied) and the <strong>fetch init</strong> (with headers, body, signal). It must return a <code>Response</code> object.</p>
<h2 id="real-world-use-cases">Real-World Use Cases</h2>
<h3 id="request-mocking-testing">Request Mocking (Testing)</h3>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre style="background-color:#22272e;color:#adbac7" tabindex="0" data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed"><code data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed" style="display: grid;"><span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">import</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> { createClient } </span><span style="color:#F47067">from</span><span style="color:#96D0FF"> "@adityadev13/solvix"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">import</span><span style="color:#F47067"> type</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> { SolvixTransport } </span><span style="color:#F47067">from</span><span style="color:#96D0FF"> "@adityadev13/solvix"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">;</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#768390">// Mock transport for tests</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">function</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> createMockTransport</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#F69D50">responses</span><span style="color:#F47067">:</span><span style="color:#F69D50"> Map</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">&#x3C;</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">string</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#F69D50">Response</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">>)</span><span style="color:#F47067">:</span><span style="color:#F69D50"> SolvixTransport</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  return</span><span style="color:#F47067"> async</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (</span><span style="color:#F69D50">url</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#F69D50">init</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">) </span><span style="color:#F47067">=></span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> mockResponse</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> responses.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">get</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(url);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    if</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (mockResponse) </span><span style="color:#F47067">return</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> mockResponse;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    return</span><span style="color:#F47067"> new</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> Response</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">JSON</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">stringify</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">({ error: </span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"not found"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> }), { status: </span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">404</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> });</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  };</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">}</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#768390">// In test:</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> mockResponses</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#F47067"> new</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> Map</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">([</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  [</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"/users"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#F47067">new</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> Response</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">JSON</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">stringify</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">([{ id: </span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">1</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> }]), { status: </span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">200</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> })],</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">]);</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> client</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> createClient</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">({</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  transport: </span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">createMockTransport</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(mockResponses),</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">});</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> res</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#F47067"> await</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> client.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">get</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"/users"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">console.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">log</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(res.data); </span><span style="color:#768390">// [{ id: 1 }]</span></span></code></pre></figure>
<h3 id="http2-transport-nodejs">HTTP/2 Transport (Node.js)</h3>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre style="background-color:#22272e;color:#adbac7" tabindex="0" data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed"><code data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed" style="display: grid;"><span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">import</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> { createClient } </span><span style="color:#F47067">from</span><span style="color:#96D0FF"> "@adityadev13/solvix"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">import</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> { request } </span><span style="color:#F47067">from</span><span style="color:#96D0FF"> "http2"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">;</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> http2Transport</span><span style="color:#F47067">:</span><span style="color:#F69D50"> SolvixTransport</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#F47067"> async</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (</span><span style="color:#F69D50">url</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#F69D50">init</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">) </span><span style="color:#F47067">=></span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  const</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> { </span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">hostname</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">pathname</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">search</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> } </span><span style="color:#F47067">=</span><span style="color:#F47067"> new</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> URL</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(url);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> session</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> connect</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">`https://${</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">hostname</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">}`</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">);</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  return</span><span style="color:#F47067"> new</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> Promise</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">((</span><span style="color:#F69D50">resolve</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#F69D50">reject</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">) </span><span style="color:#F47067">=></span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> req</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> session.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">request</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">({</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#96D0FF">      ":path"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">: pathname </span><span style="color:#F47067">+</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> search,</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#96D0FF">      ":method"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">: init.method </span><span style="color:#F47067">||</span><span style="color:#96D0FF"> "GET"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">,</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">      ...</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">Object.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">fromEntries</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#F47067">new</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> Headers</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(init.headers </span><span style="color:#F47067">||</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {})),</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    });</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> chunks</span><span style="color:#F47067">:</span><span style="color:#F69D50"> Buffer</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">[] </span><span style="color:#F47067">=</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> [];</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    req.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">on</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"data"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, (</span><span style="color:#F69D50">chunk</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">) </span><span style="color:#F47067">=></span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> chunks.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">push</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(chunk));</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    req.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">on</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"end"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, () </span><span style="color:#F47067">=></span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">      const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> body</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> Buffer.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">concat</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(chunks);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#DCBDFB">      resolve</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#F47067">new</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> Response</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(body, { status: </span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">200</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> }));</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">      session.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">close</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">();</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    });</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    req.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">on</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"error"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, reject);</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    if</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (init.body) req.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">write</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(init.body);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    req.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">end</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">();</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  });</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">};</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> client</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> createClient</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">({ transport: http2Transport });</span></span></code></pre></figure>
<h3 id="retry-with-circuit-breaker-in-transport">Retry with Circuit Breaker in Transport</h3>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre style="background-color:#22272e;color:#adbac7" tabindex="0" data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed"><code data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed" style="display: grid;"><span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">let</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> failureCount </span><span style="color:#F47067">=</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> 0</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">;</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> resilientTransport</span><span style="color:#F47067">:</span><span style="color:#F69D50"> SolvixTransport</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#F47067"> async</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (</span><span style="color:#F69D50">url</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#F69D50">init</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">) </span><span style="color:#F47067">=></span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  if</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (failureCount </span><span style="color:#F47067">></span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> 5</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">) {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    throw</span><span style="color:#F47067"> new</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> Error</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"Custom circuit breaker open"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  }</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  try</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> response</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#F47067"> await</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> fetch</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(url, init);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    failureCount </span><span style="color:#F47067">=</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> 0</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    return</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> response;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  } </span><span style="color:#F47067">catch</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (error) {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    failureCount</span><span style="color:#F47067">++</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    throw</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> error;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  }</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">};</span></span></code></pre></figure>
<h3 id="request-timing-transport">Request Timing Transport</h3>
<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=""><pre style="background-color:#22272e;color:#adbac7" tabindex="0" data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed"><code data-language="ts" data-theme="github-dark-dimmed" style="display: grid;"><span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">const</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> timingTransport</span><span style="color:#F47067">:</span><span style="color:#F69D50"> SolvixTransport</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#F47067"> async</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (</span><span style="color:#F69D50">url</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">, </span><span style="color:#F69D50">init</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">) </span><span style="color:#F47067">=></span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> start</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> performance.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">now</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">();</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">  try</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> response</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#F47067"> await</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB"> fetch</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(url, init);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> duration</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> performance.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">now</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">() </span><span style="color:#F47067">-</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> start;</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#768390">    // Collect timing metrics</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    timingHistogram.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">observe</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">({ method: init.method, url: url.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">split</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">"?"</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">)[</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">0</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">] }, duration);</span></span>
<span data-line=""> </span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    return</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> response;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  } </span><span style="color:#F47067">catch</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> (error) {</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    const</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF"> duration</span><span style="color:#F47067"> =</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> performance.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">now</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">() </span><span style="color:#F47067">-</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> start;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">    console.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">error</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">(</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">`Failed after ${</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">duration</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">.</span><span style="color:#DCBDFB">toFixed</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">(</span><span style="color:#6CB6FF">0</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">)</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">}ms: ${</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">url</span><span style="color:#96D0FF">}`</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7">);</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#F47067">    throw</span><span style="color:#ADBAC7"> error;</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">  }</span></span>
<span data-line=""><span style="color:#ADBAC7">};</span></span></code></pre></figure>
<h2 id="transport--middleware">Transport + Middleware</h2>
<p>The transport is the <strong>last stage</strong> in the pipeline — after middleware, after security checks, after everything. It receives the fully prepared URL and init object.</p>
<pre><code>Security → Queue → Rate Limit → Circuit Breaker → Retry Loop
                                                      ↓
                                              Middleware Stack
                                                      ↓
                                              Transport (fetch/custom)
</code></pre>
<h2 id="built-in-transports">Built-in Transports</h2>
<p>Solvix ships with one built-in transport:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Transport</th>
<th>Runtime</th>
<th>Requires</th>
<th>Use Case</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Default <code>fetch</code></td>
<td>All</td>
<td>Nothing</td>
<td>Standard HTTP</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Node.js Proxy/TLS</td>
<td>Node.js 18+</td>
<td><code>undici</code></td>
<td>Corporate proxies, mTLS</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2 id="best-practices">Best Practices</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Keep the transport focused</strong> — it should only handle the network layer, not business logic</li>
<li><strong>Use middleware for transformations</strong> — not transport</li>
<li><strong>Return a proper <code>Response</code> object</strong> — Solvix parses it based on <code>responseType</code></li>
<li><strong>Handle errors properly</strong> — throw or return error responses; don't swallow failures</li>
<li><strong>Test transports in isolation</strong> — mock at the transport level for unit tests</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="whats-next">What's Next</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="/docs/core-api/middleware-system">Middleware System</a> — modify requests/responses in the pipeline</li>
<li><a href="/docs/core-api/proxy">Proxy Configuration</a> — HTTP proxy via undici</li>
<li><a href="/docs/core-api/tls">TLS/SSL</a> — custom TLS configuration</li>
